            "text": "<h2>Refunds & Returns</h2><p>Due to the exclusive nature of <strong>ØDDMAN</strong> collections, <strong>all sales are final</strong>. We do not offer refunds or exchanges except in cases where an item is <strong>unavailable, incorrect, damaged, or lost in transit</strong>.</p><p>For all other return requests, we offer <strong>store credit</strong> equal to the value of your purchase (shipping not included).</p><h3>How to Initiate a Return</h3><ul><li>Email <a href=\"mailto:alldaodds@gmail.com\"><strong>alldaodds@gmail.com</strong></a> within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong></li><li>Items must be <strong>unworn</strong>, in <strong>new condition</strong>, with <strong>original tags attached</strong></li><li>Items that do not meet these conditions will be returned at your expense unless otherwise agreed upon</li></ul><p>ØDDMAN reserves the right to <strong>temporarily suspend or revoke return privileges</strong> if returns are excessive.</p><h2>How Do the Item(s) Fit?</h2><p>Fit details are provided in each product description.</p><p>Still unsure?</p><ul><li>DM us on Instagram <strong>@alldaodds</strong> for faster sizing support</li><li>Email <a href=\"mailto:alldaodds@gmail.com\"><strong>alldaodds@gmail.com</strong></a></li></ul><p></p>",
